{"version":1,"key":"card:285","content":{"id":285,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript 是单线程的，为了不阻塞线程，很多方法都是异步的，通过回调函数的形式来处理函数结果，这就会带来一个问题，当回调特别多时，代码的可读性急剧下降"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"getUser(function(user) {\n  getOrders(user.id, function(orders) {\n    getOrderDetails(orders[0].id, function(orderDetails) {\n      showOrderDetails(orderDetails);\n    });\n  });\n});","language":"js","uuid":"fd6c52d9-fdd5-4c0e-9aea-cf260c6ada38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ES6 中通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 解决这个问题。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的基本语法"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const promise = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  \n})\n\npromise.then(successCallback, errorCallback);","language":"js","uuid":"0a1d177b-aa45-46e3-b8f9-dc14f3600b4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new Promise()","code":true},{"text":"来创建一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例存在三种状态，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"pendding","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态。实例上存在一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"then","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方法，该方法接受两个函数作为参数传入，当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例变为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态时，传入 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"then","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的第一个函数将会被执行，当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例变为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态时，传入 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"then","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的第二个函数会被执行。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"new Promise()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接受一个函数作为参数，该函数接收两个参数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolve","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"reject","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这两个参数也是函数。当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new Promise()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建实例时，初始实例为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"pendding","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态，然后立即执行传入的函数，如果在函数中调用了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolve","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，那么实例的状态就变成 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态，如果调用了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"reject","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，实例的状态就变成了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意："},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态只能由 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"pendding","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 态转化而来，因此如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolve","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"reject","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都调用了，先调用的能有效地改变状态。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"传入 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolve","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值将作为参数传递给传入 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"then","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的第一个函数，传入 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"reject","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值将作为参数传递给传入 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"then","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的第二个函数"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const promise = new Promise(resolve => {\n  resolve('Hello')\n})\n\npromise.then(value => {\n  console.log(value + \" World!\"); // Hello World!\n})","language":"js","uuid":"f056aeb1-4f31-4ea9-ad66-e951bb82afbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"then","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法的返回值也是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例，因此可以实现链式调用："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"getUser()\n    .then(user => getOrders(user.id))\n    .then(orders => getOrderDetails(orders[0].id))\n    .then(orderDetails => showOrderDetails(orderDetails))\n    .catch(error => console.error(error));","language":"js","uuid":"09471f17-3981-46da-aceb-a41038eecf42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"很好的解决了回调地狱的问题。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["JavaScript/Promise"],"createTime":1692189625617,"updateTime":1752406535783,"linkedCards":[{"id":286,"target":{"key":"card:286","type":"card","id":286},"summary":"then 方法返回的 Promise 的状态是什么。分为两种情况： 该实例是 resolved 的 传入了第一个函数 返回值是 Promise ：返回的 Promise 是什么态，返回的就是什么态，可以认为返回的就是该 Promise 返回...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]},{"id":294,"target":{"key":"card:294","type":"card","id":294},"summary":"Promise 的原型上存在一个 finally 的方法，该方法接收一个函数 onFinally 作为参数，当 Promise 实例的状态变为 resolved 或 rejected 时，便会执行 onFinally 函数，该函数不接收任何...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]},{"id":295,"target":{"key":"card:295","type":"card","id":295},"summary":"Promise.resolve 返回一个 Promise ，根据传入参数的不同，返回不同的值，分为三种情况 传入一个 Promis